  "q16_the_site_capacity_taken_by_the_band_buil": {
   "text": "The site capacity taken by the band build-out (co-location on existing sites in the cities, about 2,000 new towers and their tenancies outside them) exceeds the site capacity that the densification not done would have taken.",
